From: programista-zacny <5969291+programista-zacny@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] openmax: install the HEVC and VP8 decoders to vendor

The Exynos OMX core (libExynosOMX_Core.so) loads components only from
/vendor/lib/omx/. libOMX.Exynos.HEVC.Decoder and libOMX.Exynos.VP8.Decoder
have LOCAL_MODULE_RELATIVE_PATH omx but no LOCAL_VENDOR_MODULE, so they
would install to /system/lib/omx/, where the core never looks (and where
the incompatible Android 9 blobs of the same names are copied by
gts2-common).

HEVC drives the separate HEVC decoder IP of the Exynos 5433
(exynos-hevc-dec, /dev/video10). Tested on the SM-T815 on 2026-11-08 by
installing the build-10 object to /vendor/lib/omx/: firmware "HEVC v1.0"
loads, 1080p decodes at about 15 ms per frame against 64 ms for
c2.android.hevc.decoder on a high-entropy clip, at about a sixth of the
CPU time. The HEVC driver has no secure node, so there is no secure HEVC
decoder. Logs: logs/omx-test3-hevc-20261108/.

VP8 runs on the MFC v8 (s5p-mfc-dec, "Dec input codec(14): VP8"). Tested
the same way: 1080p at 14-15 ms per frame against 45-53 ms for
c2.android.vp8.decoder, about a third of the CPU time, identical output,
two decoders at once at 54 fps each. Logs: logs/omx-test4-vp8-20261108/.
---
diff --git a/component/video/dec/hevc/Android.mk b/component/video/dec/hevc/Android.mk
index a37953f..eba0924 100644
--- a/component/video/dec/hevc/Android.mk
+++ b/component/video/dec/hevc/Android.mk
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@ LOCAL_SRC_FILES := \
 LOCAL_PRELINK_MODULE := false
 LOCAL_MODULE := libOMX.Exynos.HEVC.Decoder
 LOCAL_MODULE_RELATIVE_PATH := omx
+LOCAL_VENDOR_MODULE := true
 
 LOCAL_CFLAGS := \
     -Wno-enum-conversion \
diff --git a/component/video/dec/vp8/Android.mk b/component/video/dec/vp8/Android.mk
index 834a9c2..3888514 100644
--- a/component/video/dec/vp8/Android.mk
+++ b/component/video/dec/vp8/Android.mk
@@ -10,6 +10,7 @@ LOCAL_SRC_FILES := \
 LOCAL_PRELINK_MODULE := false
 LOCAL_MODULE := libOMX.Exynos.VP8.Decoder
 LOCAL_MODULE_RELATIVE_PATH := omx
+LOCAL_VENDOR_MODULE := true
 
 LOCAL_CFLAGS := \
     -Wno-enum-conversion \
